{"type":"data","nodes":[null,{"type":"data","data":[{"card":1,"entry":2,"missions":25,"alongside":26,"kin":27,"engines":52,"usedOn":53,"sites":54,"crewed":55,"museums":56,"hero":57},"https://www.orrerylearn.com/images/cards/fleet/mars-polar-lander.jpg",{"id":3,"name":4,"category":5,"agency":6,"country":7,"manufacturer":8,"first_flight":9,"status":10,"era":11,"epoch":12,"best_known_for":13,"credit":14,"links":15,"tagline":13,"description":24},"mars-polar-lander","Mars Polar Lander","lander","NASA","USA","Lockheed Martin","1999-12-03","FAILED","1981-2011","shuttle-and-mir","1999年在着陆时失联；这次失败促使NASA重新审视“更快、更好、更省”方针","Skeleton entry for /fleet (PRD-012 v0.2 / Phase A scaffold). Builder + agency + first-flight per public sources. Specs and gallery TBD in later phases.",[16,20],{"l":17,"u":18,"t":19},"Mars Polar Lander — Wikipedia","https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mars_Polar_Lander","intro",{"l":21,"u":22,"t":23},"Mars Polar Lander — NASA","https://science.nasa.gov/mission/mars-polar-lander-deep-space-2/","core","Mars Polar Lander是由Lockheed Martin公司建造的NASA着陆器。1999年12月，它在向火星南极地区下降时失去联系。继数月前Mars Climate Orbiter失利之后，这次失败促使NASA重新审视“更快、更好、更省”方针。",[],[],[28,32,36,40,44,48],{"id":29,"name":30,"tagline":31},"phoenix","Phoenix","火星土壤中确认的水冰",{"id":33,"name":34,"tagline":35},"insight","InSight","火星地震仪；已探测到1300多次火星地震",{"id":37,"name":38,"tagline":39},"viking-1","Viking 1","首次成功着陆火星的探测器；生物学实验",{"id":41,"name":42,"tagline":43},"viking2-lander","Viking 2 Lander","美国第二艘火星表面着陆器（乌托邦平原 1976-09-03）。Viking 1 着陆器的孪生姐妹；进行了生物学、土壤化学和气象学研究，一直工作到 1980 年",{"id":45,"name":46,"tagline":47},"surveyor-3","Surveyor 3","Apollo 12在2.5年后造访了它",{"id":49,"name":50,"tagline":51},"beagle2","Beagle 2","来自Mars Express号（2003）的英国/ESA火星着陆器。抵达时无信号；HiRISE在2015年发现它完好无损——一块太阳能板未能展开",[],[],[],[],[],"/orrery/images/fleet-galleries/mars-polar-lander/02.webp"],"uses":{"params":["id"]}}]}
